# Files the running Shiny app does not need -- keeps the shinyapps.io bundle
# lean and keeps publication figures off the public server.
#
# NOTE: rsconnect's .rscignore matches EXACT file/directory names only --
# wildcards (e.g. *.tiff) are NOT supported -- so each figure is listed by name.
# The study's 8 materials are fixed, so this list is stable. If you add or
# rename a figure, add its exact filename here.

# publication figure outputs (Fig 1b: one per material; Fig 2a/2b)
Asuragen.tiff
Imperial College.tiff
Instand.tiff
LGC SeraCare.tiff
Microbiologics.tiff
NIBSC.tiff
Thermo Fisher.tiff
Zeptometrix.tiff
fig2a.tiff
fig2a_equalaxes.tiff
fig2b.tiff

# figure-generation driver and dev-/manuscript-only files
make_pub_plots.R
renv.lock.archive
README.md
RNAStudy_for_Publication.Rproj
